== 4. Verdict ================================================== 
  CRITERION (fixed before the numbers): 
    VALIDATED     = T2 same direction, p < 0.05, adjusted sign kept 
    WEAKENED      = same direction, no longer significant 
    NOT SUPPORTED = direction reverses or effect vanishes 
  Note that a larger n lowers p almost automatically, so the 
  informative comparison is the EFFECT SIZE across tiers, not 
  whether p stayed below 0.05. 
 
  RASSF9   T1 rho -0.351 (n = 320)  ->  T2 rho -0.374 (n = 411)   VALIDATED 
           effect size change: -0.023 (107% of the original) 
 
  RASSF10  T1 rho -0.129 (n = 320)  ->  T2 rho -0.128 (n = 411)   VALIDATED 
           effect size change: +0.001 (100% of the original) 

